### 2.8 ADTTE — Time-to-Event Dataset

**一人多终点，多行结构**

| 变量 | 说明 |
|------|------|
| STUDYID | 研究编号 |
| USUBJID | 受试者ID |
| PARAMCD | 参数编码 |
| PARAM | 参数 |
| STARTDT | 起始日期 |
| ADT | 事件日期 |
| CNSR | 截尾标志 |
| AVAL | 数值 |
| EVNTDESC | 事件描述 |

**推荐PARAMCD:**
- TTRREM = time to first endocrine remission
- TTDREM = time to durable remission confirmation
- TTRREC = time to biochemical recurrence
- TTPROG = time to radiographic progression
- TTHYPO = time to new hypopituitarism
- TTSALV = time to salvage treatment
- OS = overall survival

---

## 3. 关键Derivation规则

### 3.1 Baseline取值

**原则：**
- index GKS前最近一次
- 优先窗口：90天
- 放宽至180天
- 超窗需flag

**相关flag：**
- BASE90_FL
- BASE180_FL

---

### 3.2 IGF-1 Index

BASE_IGF1I = BASE_IGF1 / BASE_IGF1_ULN

如果ULN缺失，不能直接算，需要：
- 查询中心参考范围
- 若仍无，设缺失并单列

---

### 3.3 Early vs Delayed GKS

**主分析建议预定义：**

EARLYGKS_FL = Y if SURG2GKS_MOS <= 12
                 = N if SURG2GKS_MOS > 12

**敏感性分析可试：**
- 6 months
- 24 months
- median split

---

### 3.4 Durable Remission

**推荐操作定义：**

**步骤1：** 找到首次满足以下条件的日期：
- IGF1I <= 1
- off medication
- OGTTGH < 0.4 if available

记为 first remission date

**步骤2：** 若此后直到末次随访没有 recurrence：
- DURREMISS_FL = Y

否则：
- REMISS_FL = Y
- DURREMISS_FL = N

---

### 3.5 Biochemical Recurrence

在已 remission 后，任何后续满足：
- IGF1I > 1

或
- restart/escalation of GH/IGF-lowering medication because of biochemical failure

可定义 recurrence

---

### 3.6 Tumor Progression

**优先：**

VOLCHG_PCT > 20%

若无可靠体积：
- 采用影像判读 progression

---

### 3.7 New Hypopituitarism

某垂体轴在基线无缺陷，GKS后首次出现缺陷：

NEWDEF_FL = Y

**Subject-level:**
- 任一轴新缺陷 = HYPOPIT_FL=Y

---

